              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can I apply for drug licence online from Bangalore?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes. Karnataka Drugs Control Department has a fully online portal at drugs.karnataka.gov.in. Digital submissions with e-payment and computerised SMS alerts. Premises inspection is the only in-person step."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What is the drug licence fee in Bangalore?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Govt fees: retail Rs 600-1,500, wholesale Rs 1,500-3,000, manufacturing Rs 3,500-6,000. Patron all-inclusive from Rs 9,999 for retail covering KSPC coordination, filing, and inspection prep."
