<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Drug License Process in Bangalore</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Our CA team handles the complete drug licence process - from KSPC registration to licence grant. Filed on drugs.karnataka.gov.in with SMS tracking.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Obtain KSPC Registration for Pharmacist</h3><p class="step-description">Register the qualified pharmacist (D.Pharm/B.Pharm) with Karnataka State Pharmacy Council. Mandatory prerequisite - the Drugs Controller will not process the licence application without KSPC certificate. Patron coordinates this as the first step.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>KSPC mandatory</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>2-4 weeks</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="35" y="22" width="50" height="8" rx="2" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.3"/><rect x="35" y="36" width="40" height="5" rx="2" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.15"/><rect x="35" y="46" width="30" height="5" rx="2" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.15"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">KSPC</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Prepare Premises Per Karnataka Standards</h3><p class="step-description">Set up pharmacy with minimum 10 sq metre carpet area (15 for combined). Install refrigerator, AC, adequate shelving, dispensing counter. For Schedule X drugs, separate locked cabinet with restricted access.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>10 sq m minimum</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Fridge + AC required</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="65" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="20" width="30" height="45" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="65" y="20" width="30" height="25" rx="3" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="65" y="50" width="30" height="15" rx="2" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.1"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Premises</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Compile Application Documents</h3><p class="step-description">Form 19/19C, Additional Information Sheet, premises sketch, KSPC certificate (original), rental agreement/ownership proof, qualification proofs, PAN, Aadhaar, photograph, notarised affidavit, fee challan.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Form 19/19C</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>KSPC original</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="30" y1="22" x2="90" y2="22" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="30" y1="36" x2="85" y2="36" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="30" y1="48" x2="75" y2="48" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Documents</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Submit on Karnataka Portal</h3><p class="step-description">Register on drugs.karnataka.gov.in, upload scanned documents, fill online form, make e-payment. Unique application number generated. SMS alerts at every processing stage. Patron handles complete portal filing.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>drugs.karnataka.gov.in</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>SMS tracking</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="60" rx="8" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="90" cy="60" r="10" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M85 60l3 3 7-7" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Portal Filing</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Premises Inspection by ADCLA</h3><p class="step-description">ADCLA for Bangalore zone schedules premises inspection. Inspector verifies carpet area, storage, refrigeration, Schedule X lock-and-key, and confirms qualified pharmacist presence. Typically 2-3 weeks after application.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>ADCLA inspection</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Pharmacist verified</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="6" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="60" cy="35" r="15" fill="none" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M55 35h10M60 30v10" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Inspection</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Licence Grant and Compliance Setup</h3><p class="step-description">ADCLA grants drug licence upon satisfactory inspection. Licence dispatched by post with SMS alert. Display at premises. 14-digit number on all invoices. Patron sets up retention fee calendar (every 5 years) and compliance monitoring.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Licence granted</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Retention managed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="25" y="10" width="70" height="55" rx="6" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M48 32l8 8 16-16" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="60" y="62" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">LICENSED</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Granted</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>

